  "details": "As far as I was able to tell the self assignable toggle does absolutely nothing.\n\nI assume the expected behavior is if toggled, members of the group can add or remove themselves from these roles at will.\n\nCurrently regular members cannot see their roles on the website and only see a single role through the app. Members can self assign only when given the permission \"Manage Group Roles.\" This puts regular members into the Management category and ignores the \"Self Assignable\" property.",
